    "updated_at": "2019-10-03T15:36:03Z",
    "body": "> Eliminating FrozenArray would syntactically allow `sequence<>` in attributes,\r\n\r\nFor what it's worth, Gecko's parser allows `sequence<>` in attributes _only_ if `[Cached]` is used.  There's no problem with non-frozen sequence-typed attributes per se; there's a problem with non-cached ones, since you'd get a new value on each get...",
