    "body": "I don't think that's currently being proposed, especially because there is no concept of \"same sequence\", really: sequences are passed by value, so the best you could do is define that two sequences are \"the same\" if the lengths are the same and all the items are \"the same\", but then you have to define what \"the same\" means for `Item` in that case...",
